This product is a modified fork of nf-prov v1.7.0
(https://github.com/nextflow-io/nf-prov), Copyright Seqera Labs, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Retained from nf-prov, with modifications: the plugin entry point, the
observer/renderer framework and the `nextflow.prov` package layout
(ProvPlugin, ProvObserver, ProvObserverFactory, Renderer, FairscapeConfig)
and util/ProvHelper.groovy, which is unchanged. Those files carry the
original Seqera Labs copyright header.

Everything else is new work: the FAIRSCAPE EVI renderer
(renderers/FairscapeRenderer.groovy) and the packages under
nextflow.prov.datasheet, nextflow.prov.schema and nextflow.prov.util.

The datasheet, evidence-graph, LinkML/D4D and tabular-schema-inference code
is a Groovy port of fairscape-cli (https://github.com/fairscape/fairscape-cli)
and fairscape_models, also Apache-2.0. HTML templates under
src/main/resources/fairscape/templates/ are verbatim copies from
fairscape-cli.
